@startuml Sequence Diagram - View Billing History

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "BillingView" as BillingView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

Admin -> BillingView : 1 Open billing/history page
activate BillingView
BillingView -> BillingView : 2 Display billing history view

BillingView -> ClerkAuth : 3 Request billing history
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 4 Fetch billing records
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 5 Retrieve billing history
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 6 Return billing data
ClerkAuth -> BillingView : 7 Return billing history
BillingView -> Admin : 8 Display billing history

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate BillingView

@enduml
